sentences.text:
Mr. Rutvij Oza for the respondent no.2-State has submitted before this Lok Adalat that the offence committed by the respondent no.1-accused is an offence punishable under Sections 59(1)
for violation of Section 26(2) (1)(ii) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, and therefore,
settlement between the parties would not be possible in the Lok Adalat, today.

